# This test builds a fulltext index over ~1M rows. It runs in about 130s
# locally (macbook M5), but these tests run 7 - 10 times slower on GitHub and
# it consistently blows through the default 15 minute testcase timeout.
#
# Estimate is that workflow runners will take about 20 minutes, and give it
# %50 percent headroom so allow 30 minutes.
--testcase-timeout=30
